    "solution": "Hop and dash down-right onto the runway. Jump after landing has returned the dash: the extended wavedash stays beneath the low thorn ceiling and above the first patrol. Carry its speed, then use the recovered dash to reach the distant pod. A low cut restores the dash while keeping the rebound below the same roof. Clear its end and dash up-right through the second patrol lane onto the exit shelf.",
